  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>The Cell Salt Company is bringing cell salts—a well-established form of mineral support in Europe—to a new generation of American families. Our flagship Daily Blend combines all 12 cell salts in one convenient, 400-tablet bottle.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>Cell salts are widely known in Europe but remain largely untapped in the U.S. We’re building a modern American brand around this 150-year-old system of mineral support—with simple products, beautiful branding and approachable education.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>Get in early as we grow this category in the U.S. Earn commission on every purchase made through your unique referral link.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Share your experience, wellness routines, “What are cell salts?” education, mineral-focused content, or introduce your audience to a wellness category they may have never heard of. Cell salts provide foundational mineral support for teeth, hair, bones, skin, energy, and emotional well-being.</p><p>They’re remarkably easy to take and kid-friendly—small tablets that dissolve under the tongue, making mineral support simple for the whole family.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We’re a small, family-owned U.S. brand with big plans. The Daily Blend is just the beginning, with the 12 individual cell salts coming next.</p></div></div>",
